WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.262 --> 00:00:02.262
Method of taking Samayik

00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:06.589
First place your right hand in front of 
 Sthapana Charyaji,

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:08.629
and recite the Navkar Mantra and 
 Pachindiya.

00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:10.629
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:00:10.869 --> 00:00:14.258
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae 
 Nisihiae,

00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:15.653
Matthaena Vandami.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.851
recite Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari, Annattha sutra

00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:28.382
then in the Kausagg Mudra 
Chant 1 Logassa (untill Chandesu Nimmalayara)

00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:29.640
If you don't know,

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.773
then chant four Navkar Mantras in Kausagg Mudra

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:34.102
then recite Logassa

00:00:34.297 --> 00:00:38.622
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.622
Matthaena Vandami.

00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:46.361
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:00:46.361 --> 00:00:49.133
Samayik Muhapatti Padilehu? Ichcham.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.216
having said this,

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.046
recite Muhaptti ke 50 bol

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.434
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.835
Matthaena Vandami.

00:01:11.558 --> 00:01:13.689
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:01:13.689 --> 00:01:16.148
Samayik Sadisahu? Ichchham

00:01:16.268 --> 00:01:19.818
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae 
 Nisihiae,

00:01:19.818 --> 00:01:21.458
Matthaena Vandami.

00:01:25.399 --> 00:01:27.737
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:01:27.737 --> 00:01:29.758
Samayik Thau? Ichchham

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.066
Saying this,

00:01:31.066 --> 00:01:33.472
fold your hands and 
 count 1 Navkar Mantra

00:01:33.472 --> 00:01:34.923
Ichhakari Bhagwan

00:01:34.923 --> 00:01:37.622
Passay Kari Samayik 
 Dandak Uchchrav Shoji

00:01:37.808 --> 00:01:41.171
Saying this, with both hands joined 
 on the forehead,

00:01:41.171 --> 00:01:44.196
chant 1 Navakar and recite Karemi Bhante

00:01:44.469 --> 00:01:48.641
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.368
Matthaena Vandami.

00:01:55.095 --> 00:01:57.236
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan !

00:01:57.236 --> 00:01:59.604
Besane Sandisahu? Ichchham

00:01:59.604 --> 00:02:03.939
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:02:03.939 --> 00:02:05.350
Matthaena Vandami.

00:02:09.332 --> 00:02:11.342
Ichchakarena Sandisah Bhagawan!

00:02:11.342 --> 00:02:13.439
Besane Thau? Ichchham

00:02:13.614 --> 00:02:17.782
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:02:17.782 --> 00:02:19.454
Matthaena Vandami.

00:02:23.788 --> 00:02:25.699
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan!

00:02:25.699 --> 00:02:28.240
Sajjai Sandisah? Ichchham

00:02:28.535 --> 00:02:32.631
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:02:32.631 --> 00:02:34.139
Matthaena Vandami.

00:02:38.407 --> 00:02:40.492
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan!

00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:42.529
Sajjai Karu? Ichchham.

00:02:42.802 --> 00:02:45.299
Saying this, with joint hands

00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:47.476
chant the Navkar mantra three times.

00:02:47.629 --> 00:02:48.987
Then, for 48 minutes,

00:02:48.987 --> 00:02:51.811
meditate on Navkar and self-study.

